{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given number is a Woodall number (n * 2^n - 1 for n >= 1).\"\"\"\n    if number <= 0:\n        return False\n\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        candidate = n * (1 << n) - 1\n        if candidate == number:\n            return True\n        if candidate > number:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
