{"task_id": "Mbpp/93", "solution": "def power(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Compute a to the power of b using binary exponentiation for integer exponents.\n    Handles zero, negative, and fractional exponents.\n    \"\"\"\n    if b == 0:\n        return 1.0\n\n    if b < 0:\n        return 1.0 / power(a, -b)\n\n    if isinstance(b, int) or b.is_integer():\n        result = 1.0\n        exp = int(b)\n        base = a\n        while exp > 0:\n            if exp % 2 == 1:\n                result *= base\n            base *= base\n            exp //= 2\n        return result\n\n    return a ** b"}
