{"task_id": "Mbpp/770", "solution": "def odd_num_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the fourth power of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    Raises ValueError if n is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        odd_num = 2 * i - 1\n        total_sum += odd_num * odd_num * odd_num * odd_num\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/771", "solution": "def check_expression(expression: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given expression has balanced brackets using a stack.\"\"\"\n    stack = []\n    opening_brackets = \"([{\"\n    closing_brackets = \")]}\"\n    bracket_map = {')': '(', '}': '{', ']': '['}\n\n    for char in expression:\n        if char in opening_brackets:\n            stack.append(char)\n        elif char in closing_brackets:\n            if not stack:\n                return False\n            top_char = stack.pop()\n            if bracket_map[char] != top_char:\n                return False\n    return not stack"}
