{"task_id": "Mbpp/3", "solution": "import math\ndef is_not_prime(n):\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is not prime based on primality rules.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n    if n == 2:\n        return False\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return True\n\n    limit = int(math.sqrt(n))\n    for i in range(3, limit + 1, 2):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return True\n    return False"}
