{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(sequence, pattern):\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if the given sequence follows the same structural pattern as the pattern list.\n    This means elements at corresponding positions must maintain consistent mappings.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(sequence) != len(pattern):\n        return False\n\n    seq_to_pat = {}\n    pat_to_seq = {}\n\n    for s_elem, p_elem in zip(sequence, pattern):\n        # Check mapping from sequence element to pattern element\n        if s_elem in seq_to_pat:\n            if seq_to_pat[s_elem] != p_elem:\n                return False\n        else:\n            seq_to_pat[s_elem] = p_elem\n\n        # Check mapping from pattern element to sequence element\n        if p_elem in pat_to_seq:\n            if pat_to_seq[p_elem] != s_elem:\n                return False\n        else:\n            pat_to_seq[p_elem] = s_elem\n\n    return True"}
