{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in an array.\n\n    Raises ValueError if the array contains no non-zero elements.\"\"\"\n    zeroes = 0\n    non_zeroes = 0\n    for x in array:\n        if x == 0:\n            zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            non_zeroes += 1\n    \n    if non_zeroes == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Array contains no non-zero elements, cannot compute ratio.\")\n        \n    return float(zeroes / non_zeroes)"}
