{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "def replace_spaces(input_str: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Replaces all whitespace characters with underscores and all underscores with spaces in the input string.\n    This implementation iterates through the string and builds a new one with the swapped characters.\n    \"\"\"\n    transformed_chars = []\n    for char in input_str:\n        if char.isspace():\n            transformed_chars.append('_')\n        elif char == '_':\n            transformed_chars.append(' ')\n        else:\n            transformed_chars.append(char)\n    return ''.join(transformed_chars)"}
